{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_13_level_main_13-04_beg","groupId":"main_13","stageId":"main_13-04","title":"苦厄盤桓","storyCode":"13-5","avgTag":"行動前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_13-04_beg.txt","sourceHash":"297d9f62a588626109c3a493a21cf86db50b778557438fe474f5a86f90c8cea5","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"救下了博士和阿米婭的Logos一行也遇到了幻境，Logos看到了女妖的河谷，想起了自己成為女妖之主時對母親的誓言。他們遇上了明椒率領的後勤小隊，並徵用了該小隊的車。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"霧氣越來越濃了，整片森林幾乎都沉浸其中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"其實，我並不熟悉卡茲戴爾，女妖的王庭在兩百年前的戰爭之後，就已經離開了那座城市。我在女妖的河谷長大。\n我曾經問過母親，為什麼她作為“六英雄”之一，卻選擇離開那座她曾為之奮戰到底的卡茲戴爾。\n當時母親沒有回答，她從河邊撿起了幾條蘆葦，為我編了一條項鍊，那些草莖相互纏繞，首尾相連。\n很漂亮，我將它視作珍寶，但是很快，它就乾枯變色，成了些鬆散的碎片。\n母親告訴我，那是女妖最傳統的技藝，我們編織歌聲與咒文，就如同編織青草的項鍊。\n可是，我們現在擁有了整個河谷。\n它們不用被採擷，不用被纏繞，所以它們年復一年，永遠生長。\n女妖唱響輓歌，但輓歌不是終結的哀告，而是新生的期許。\n薩卡茲們需要的，不是守住一座待死的城，而是，生長。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的環境讓人很不安，博士，我們之前還在一片密林中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"隨著霧氣漸濃，我們眼前的景色已然迥異。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一片……河谷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這些東西都是幻覺嗎，Logos？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士負傷不輕，但語調已經恢復了沉穩。\n阿斯卡綸沉默地抱著還未醒來的阿米婭，走在前列。\n她和往常一樣，一言不發。但我能察覺到，她如今的沉默，比以往……更加暗淡。\n我還記得她與我匆忙會合的時候，那一閃而過的，我難以分辨的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幻象自虛無中來，它們只是人腦中虛構的景色，就算再逼真也只會被歸為虛假。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而這裡不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的所有東西，都曾經真實地存在過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"構築這樣一個，“幻境”，不僅需要情報與訊息，甚至需要，時間與空間。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這太困難。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"骨哨聲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我熟悉這片河谷。\n我一直愛著這裡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，女妖們的骨哨。未必有源石技藝的意味。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們還小的時候，會在河邊練習骨哨，我們會坐在草叢中，靜靜等待。直到小蟲被大鱗吞下，直到大鱗被羽獸捉起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"骨哨聲就會在此時鳴響。"},{"type":"narration","text":"這裡為什麼會有這樣的景色？我們怎麼才能離開？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在嘗試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種並非源石技藝的力量，只可能與更加古老的力量有關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但它不該出現在這片戰場上，出現在倫蒂尼姆的周邊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所有的聲音和場景都很難分辨真假，我們這支隊伍的狀態不好，必須提高警惕。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"河谷的那邊，似乎有個人正在默默佇立。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……母親。"},{"type":"narration","text":"Logos，怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘗試直接撕裂這片景色吧，這有些風險，但卻是最好的方法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道離開這裡是否安全，阿斯卡綸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸點了點頭，把阿米婭交給了博士，博士勉強用沒受傷的那隻手扶住了她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸，這位刺客大師轉眼間就消失進霧靄之中。\n我閉目準備，構思著破壞，想像著重建。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"但那個人影又出現了，這次在河谷邊的小山上，她好像在看著我，也好像只是過去的切片，停滯在了往昔裡的某個時間。\n那座小山我很熟悉，小的時候，我總是在那裡練習咒術，等到暮色漸起，她就會出現在我的身後。\n我從來不知道她到底是什麼時候來的，她只是站在那裡，如同這裡的幻象一樣。\n等到我精疲力盡，我們就會一起回家。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我摸出了自己的骨哨，冰涼冷冽，如同我第一次得到它的時候一樣。\n在不久前，我為變形者王庭的消散吹響了它。\n而它再上一次響起，就是在這片河谷之中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我明天就會出發，前往巴別塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經是女妖王庭的主人，記得向特蕾西婭殿下帶去我的問候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這一切還是沒有真實感，母親。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"作為王庭之主，我太過年輕了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，怎麼會呢，你的傑出有目共睹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的骨哨，我為它調了律，加上了王庭的徽記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，還有一個充滿魔力的吻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要骨哨聲響起，所有薩卡茲都會知道，這是喪鐘的意志。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"母親，女妖之主應該做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做你認為必須做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我曾和您談起過我的那些……瘋話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"被束縛的薩卡茲沒有出路，就如同您曾經送給我的編織項鍊，結果只有破碎一途。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而束縛我們的，正是我們的身份，我們的所屬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“王庭”，也許還有，“魔王”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可您還是把這個身份交給了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"滅亡的終點一旦抵達，腐朽的軀骸就永不可能再度甦生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但……這就是規律。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們為一切鳴響喪鐘，為他人，也為自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這是要肩負責任的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若你覺得我們古老的傳承早已成為新生的墊腳石，你就應該去親自確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倘若你沒有改變你的看法——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——“新生從滅亡中來”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我把骨哨送到了嘴邊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，真不賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女妖","speakerId":"avg_npc_1071_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小小的新任女妖之主啊，您第一首稚嫩的喪鐘為誰而鳴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……為我自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"為所有過去和未來將要腐朽的王庭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g2_reedmarshes"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"薩卡茲必須書寫新的詞句。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“停滯的景觀有何意義？”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"力量隨言語迸發。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"43_g8_wildernesswarcircle"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":"avg_npc_395_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"血魔的巫術。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但血魔無法營造出剛才的景觀，恐怕還有別的存在在幫助他。"},{"type":"narration","text":"血魔想用這些法陣做什麼？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士吃力地扶著阿米婭，有些擔憂地仰頭看著巨大的血色結晶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的迴路並不完整，但是……有幾個可被閱讀的象徵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“純化”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……它想對我們的血脈產生影響。對薩卡茲的血脈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這種術式……與薩卡茲的力量有關。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士並沒有回應，好像在思考著什麼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"呵，他們終於按耐不住了。\n我已經察覺這些人很久了，幾個粗陋的遊蕩者。那些錯亂的時空遮蔽了他們的身影，如今，霧氣已散去，他們終於現身。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿斯卡綸手中的銀光已經襲上他們的頸間，自骨筆瀉出的咒文擋下了他們的攻擊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一枚土塊？簡直像孩子般草率。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿斯卡綸","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"等等！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我就說，他們是真的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些鬼魂是真的！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"啊，還真是個孩子。\n你是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士和眼前的這個薩卡茲女孩認識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是那個，“博士”？我在海布里區的軍工廠看見過你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼會在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有一個昏迷的卡特斯，和……薩卡茲？"},{"type":"narration","text":"在諾伯特區，你為難民們提供了物資。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼知道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別、別亂說！我只是，呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這位卡特斯小姐的狀態好像不太好？你的胳膊也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們，呃，你們跟薩卡茲在一起，應該……沒什麼問題吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們好像回到原來的地方了，但這次是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"我不想再看見頂著光環的怪獸了，根本沒道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲憊的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，你怎麼在跟那些鬼魂說話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兇狠的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"一個……戴著兜帽的人，一隻昏迷的兔子，還有個薩卡茲？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是！司機小姐，他們是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這個薩卡茲走到我的面前，狐疑地上下打量著我。\n我一眼就能看出來，她根本沒上過戰場，她手上的老繭位置不對。\n剛才那個叫明椒的小姑娘，喊她司機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚哇！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"礦工，你也來看看，果然是真的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“礦工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"你……你這身衣服，挺值錢對吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"精明的薩卡茲","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你再仔細看看！算了，你這種烏薩斯來的鄉巴佬怎麼會懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“礦工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"老財，別每次把自己說得像是什麼卡茲戴爾的大人物，你不過是在那有家雜貨店而已！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“礦工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我忘了，你還把你的店賣了，就為了來這裡找架打，哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老財”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放尊重點！別在他面前造次！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老財”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，哈哈……您也許在卡茲戴爾見過我，我的雜貨店還算有點名氣……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"這個外號老財的男人搓著手，諂媚地看著我。\n他的刀上還帶著輔助控制源石技藝的儀器，這東西應該價格不菲。可惜，包括刀本身，都是全新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老財”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是……王庭的成員，對吧？我認得您這身衣服……您是，土石之子？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"……\n看來這傢伙並不了解什麼王庭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我是女妖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"男性女妖？女妖不基本都是女性嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼，我在卡西米爾可從來沒聽說過男女妖……呃，我是不是太失禮了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“司機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_935_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明椒，你居然認識這種大人物？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……不、不算認識吧……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們在運貨？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我看見他們的貨車中，沒被布蓋著的地方，幾塊流著血紋的結晶暴露出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們要把這些物資運去哪裡？這些好像是儀式的材料？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃……我不知道該怎麼說，我們只是跟著路線圖巡查，有些法陣會有點損壞，我們就要修好它們。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士看了我一眼，我似乎有所悟。薩卡茲貨車，能帶我們穿越戰場的載具。\n按照阿米婭現在的狀態，我們不可能步行去與大部隊會合。\n我能感覺到，陰影中的阿斯卡綸已經做好了準備，隨時可以攻擊眼前這支外行的小隊。\n但顯然，博士已經有了更好的辦法。\n尊貴的女妖大人，我們這樣不可能活著穿越戰場，求求你乾脆讓我們解脫吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我馬上理解了博士的想法，但……我真的很不熟悉做這種事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的運輸隊被我徵用了。我們正在執行極其特殊的任務，卻在路上遇到了襲擊，你們的協助將會被我銘記。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老財”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，能夠為王庭成員服務是我們的榮幸，閣下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老財”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是……被報喪女妖銘記……總覺得不太吉利。能不能……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是報酬。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"得感謝Mechanist在我口袋裡塞的硬幣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“老財”","speakerId":"avg_npc_932_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，感謝老爺！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們的運輸任務……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事後我會向你的上級說明。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“礦工”","speakerId":"avg_npc_054","isRemote":false,"text":"特殊任務？為什麼會帶著這兩個異族人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……他們是我的俘虜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"俘虜？可是，你們……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧……但結束之後，你們要和我一起去見曼弗雷德將軍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"明椒","speakerId":"avg_4071_peper_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們先去整理幾個位置出來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士走到了我的身邊，語氣很嚴肅。\nLogos，想辦法分一輛車給阿斯卡綸。\n赦罪師的襲擊並不單純，他們與血魔一起行動，但卻把阿米婭帶離了那條船。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，你在擔心？"},{"type":"narration","text":"可露希爾和自救軍的隊伍中沒有適合的戰鬥人員，凱爾希受了傷，閃靈很強大，但赦罪師一定為她單獨準備了手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我明白了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"阿米婭的狀態恐怕不是藥物所能治癒的，她現在更需要的，是在醒來之前，不再落入赦罪師們的視線之中。\n藉助這支小隊行動，反而會更安全。\n我會讓阿斯卡綸支援凱爾希，這裡有你在。\n況且……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"博士憂心忡忡地看著血色的法陣。\n不必說，我更了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Logos","speakerId":"avg_npc_1072_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些結晶……不是簡單的源石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
